 MB cap             |\n25\t\n26\t---\n27\t\n28\t## 2. Checkpoint file schema\n29\t\n30\tFile: `agent_sandbox/checkpoints/<name>.json`  \n31\tPinned file: `workspaces/<ws>/checkpoints/<name>.json`\n32\t\n33\t```jsonc\n34\t{\n35\t  \"schema\": \"aamp.checkpoint/1\",\n36\t  \"name\": \"after-data-load\",\n37\t  \"workspace\": \"c5_test\",\n38\t  \"saved_at\": \"2026-05-12T14:30:00Z\",\n39\t\n40\t  // The full conversation up to the save point.\n41\t  // Automatically compacted (compact-prompt-auto.md) when serialised\n42\t  // size exceeds 2 MB; the first message in that case is the compact summary.\n43\t  \"history\": [\n44\t    { \"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"...\" },\n45\t    { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"load the Q3 sales data\" },\n46\t    { \"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Loading ~/data/q3_sales.csv now...\\n_____javascript\\n...\" }\n47\t  ],\n48\t\n49\t  // Skill IDs to re-invoke via space.skills.load() on restore.\n50\t  \"skills\": [\"browser-control\", \"data-analyst\"],"}]},"uuid":"f92f9403-8755-44f7-917a-2b9456a19dc4","timestamp":"2026-07-25T13:26:18.989Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\architecture\\SOLUTION-H-session-checkpoints.md","content":"# Solution Design — Phase H: Session Checkpoints\n\n**Status:** draft  \n**Phase:** H (H1 → H2 → H3)  \n**Author:** Binary 16  \n**Date:** 2026-05-12  \n**Companion:** [`REQUIREMENTS-H-session-checkpoints.md`](REQUIREMENTS-H-session-checkpoints.md)\n\n---\n\n## 1. Overview\n\nSession checkpoints extend the existing `agent_sandbox/` write pattern (Phase D3) with a dedicated `checkpoints/` subdir and three new runtime endpoints. The browser side adds a `session_checkpoint/` module inside `_prime_silo/` that wraps those endpoints with the same scope-chokepoint model used by `runtime_client/`. Pinning (Phase H3) reuses the Phase F2 signing pipeline without modification.\n\nThe implementation deliberately reuses every existing co